---

<BaseLayout
    title={pageTitle}
    description={pageDescription}
>
    <!-- Structured JSON-LD Schema Graph -->
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(pageSchema)} />

    <main class="dcrs-service-page">

        <!-- 1. HERO / OPENING ------------------------------------------------>
        <header class="dcrs-hero-banner">
            <div class="dcrs-hero-banner__scrim"></div>
            <div class="dcrs-container dcrs-hero-banner__inner">
                <nav class="dcrs-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
                    <ol>
                        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/#service">Services</a></li>
                        <li aria-current="page">Car Battery Replacement Dubai</li>
                    </ol>
                </nav>
                <span class="dcrs-badge">Al Satwa, Dubai · Workshop &amp; Mobile Service · All Makes &amp; Models</span>
                <h1 class="dcrs-hero-banner__title">
                    Car Battery Replacement Dubai - Mobile &amp; Workshop Fitting
                </h1>
                <p class="dcrs-hero-banner__lead">
                    Car battery replacement in Dubai involves checking your existing battery, testing the vehicle's charging system, and installing a suitable replacement when necessary. Dubai Car Repair Service provides battery testing and replacement for different vehicle makes and models. You can visit our Al Satwa workshop or request mobile battery replacement at your home, office, or roadside location, subject to availability. Our technicians check the battery specifications and installation requirements to help ensure reliable starting performance.
                </p>
                <div class="dcrs-hero-banner__actions">
                    <a href={phoneHref} class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--solid">
                        <Fragment set:html={icons.phone} /> Call {phoneDisplay}
                    </a>
                    <a href={waHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--wa">
                        <Fragment set:html={icons.chat} /> WhatsApp Us
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- 2. SERVICE OVERVIEW ---------------------------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-section dcrs-section--paper" id="service-overview">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-grid-2col dcrs-grid-2col--align-center">
                    
                    <div class="dcrs-intro-content">
                        <div class="dcrs-kicker">Service Overview</div>
                        <h2 class="dcrs-heading__title">
                            Car Battery Replacement Dubai - Diagnostics, Testing &amp; Installation
                        </h2>
                        <p class="dcrs-lead-text">
                            Car batteries in Dubai face tough operating conditions. High summer temperatures accelerate chemical reactions inside the battery, leading to internal corrosion and fluid evaporation over time. While batteries in cooler climates often last four years or more, most vehicles in the UAE need a replacement battery every two to three years.
                        </p>
                        <p class="dcrs-body-text">
                            Before replacing a battery, it is important to test it properly. Our technicians use digital testers to check the battery's voltage, internal condition, and cranking power. We also test your alternator and charging circuit to confirm whether the issue is genuinely a weak battery or an alternator that is not charging properly. For broader starting issues or electrical concerns, our workshop also provides <a href="/car-engine-service-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">engine electrical diagnostics</a> and <a href="/car-inspection-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">vehicle safety inspections</a>.
                        </p>
                        <p class="dcrs-body-text">
                            When a replacement is needed, we help you select a battery that matches your car's factory size, power rating, and electrical requirements. You can bring your vehicle to our workshop at 222 Al Satwa Road, or request our <a href="/mobile-car-repair-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">mobile car repair service</a> to have a technician come to your home, office, or breakdown location, subject to availability.
                        </p>

                        <div class="dcrs-action-row">
                            <a href={phoneHref} class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--solid">
                                <Fragment set:html={icons.phone} /> Call Mechanic
                            </a>
                            <a href={waHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--outline-ink">
                                Book On WhatsApp <Fragment set:html={icons.arrowRight} />
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="dcrs-intro-media">
                        <div class="dcrs-intro-media__frame">
                            <img
                                src={service5Image.src}
                                alt="Technician performing car battery replacement in Dubai with digital conductance tester at Al Satwa workshop"
                                loading="eager"
                                width="600"
                                height="400"
                            />
                            <div class="dcrs-plate dcrs-price-badge" aria-hidden="true">
                                <div class="dcrs-plate__tab">AED</div>
                                <div class="dcrs-plate__body">
                                    <span class="dcrs-plate__row dcrs-plate__row--big">150+</span>
                                    <span class="dcrs-plate__row">STARTING PRICE</span>
                                    <span class="dcrs-plate__row">INSTALLATION INCLUDED</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 3. PRICING ------------------------------------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-section dcrs-section--tint" id="pricing">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-heading dcrs-heading--center">
                    <div class="dcrs-kicker">Transparent Pricing</div>
                    <h2 class="dcrs-heading__title">
                        Car Battery Replacement Pricing in Dubai
                    </h2>
                    <p class="dcrs-heading__sub">
                        Clear, transparent pricing based on battery chemistry, capacity, and vehicle requirements. Standard installation and battery testing are included with replacement.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="dcrs-table-wrapper">
                    <table class="dcrs-pricing-table">
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th>Battery / Service Type</th>
                                <th>Price Range (AED)</th>
                                <th>Warranty Status</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            {pricingRows.map((r) => (
                                <tr>
                                    <td class="dcrs-table-service"><strong>{r.type}</strong></td>
                                    <td class="dcrs-table-price">{r.price}</td>
                                    <td class="dcrs-table-warranty">{r.warranty}</td>
                                </tr>
                            ))}
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>

                <p class="dcrs-pricing-disclaimer">
